# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day 03

## Topic
# Present Perfect + How long / for / since

---

## Rule

### How long ~ ?

현재까지 얼마나 지속되었는지 물어볼 때 사용한다.

Structure

How long + have/has + 주어 + p.p?

---

## Examples

How long have you lived here?

→ I've lived here for five years.

---

How long has she worked at the company?

→ She has worked there since 2022.

---

How long have they known each other?

→ They have known each other for ten years.

---

## Remember

How long → 기간 질문

for → 기간

since → 시작 시점

---

## TOEIC Tip

How long 질문이 나오면

✔ for
✔ since

를 가장 먼저 떠올리자.
